## SOARE syntax highlighting rules for Nano

syntax "soare" "\.soare$"
magic "SOARE script"

## Keywords
color brightblue "\<(let|as|else|end|fn|break|if|iferror|loadimport|or|raise|return|try|while)\>"

## Built-in functions
color magenta "\<(chr|ord|random|soareinfo|eval|time|write|werr|input|system)\>"

## Operators
color magenta "[.:;,+*|=!\%]" "<" ">" "/" "-" "&"

## Parentheses
color magenta "[()]"

## Numbers
icolor brightyellow "\b(([1-9][0-9]+)|0+)\.[0-9]+j?\b" "\b([1-9][0-9]*[Lj]?)\b" "\b0o?[0-7]*L?\b" "\b0x[1-9a-f][0-9a-f]*L?\b" "\b0b[01]+\b"

## Strings
color yellow "[`][^`]*[^\\][`]" "[`]{3}.*[^\\][`]{3}"
color yellow "['][^']*[^\\][']" "[']{3}.*[^\\][']{3}"
color yellow "["][^"]*[^\\]["]" "["]{3}.*[^\\]["]{3}"

## Comment
color green "\?.*"
